      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَآءَتْ تَسْتَرْجِمُ النَّبِىَّ</span></b> , said of a woman [who
had committed adultery], means <i>She came asking
the Prophet for</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الرَّجْم</span> [i. e. <i>to be stoned.</i>] (TA.)

